  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges.\n• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle over 1/2 of the All-American spice blend. Drizzle with olive oil and toss coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316949af9401b832901334b/step-a6352f9a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Drain the sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are “popping” out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316949af9401b832901334b/step-fdc942ac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. In a medium bowl, combine the remaining All-American spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi, turning to coat.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the honey, turning haloumi to coat, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Remove pan from heat.\n• To the bowl with the corn, add Dijon mustard and 1/2 the mayonnaise. Add slaw mix. Toss to coat. TIP: Keep an eye on the haloumi as the spice blend will char quickly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316949af9401b832901334b/step-04904241.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Divide American BBQ haloumi, corn slaw and sweet potato wedges between plates.\n• Tear over parsley. Garnish with chilli. Serve with remaining mayo. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316949af9401b832901334b/step-abd70c6a.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
